  {
    "knowledge_point": {
      "db_id": 17592186087699,
      "id": "9b9ef325-2358-5041-8a8d-b459e8ed9f09",
      "title": "Determining the Inverse of a 2x2 Matrix"
    },
    "question": {
      ":question/id": "ffed5c2c-839c-5f3e-8b6f-340c2323f59e",
      ":question/problem": "Consider the matrices\n$A = \\begin{bmatrix}3 & -2 \\\\ 1 & -2\\end{bmatrix}, B = \\begin{bmatrix}\\frac{1}{2} & \\frac{1}{4} \\\\ -\\frac{1}{2} & -\\frac{3}{4}\\end{bmatrix}, C = \\begin{bmatrix}\\frac{1}{2} & -\\frac{1}{2} \\\\ \\frac{1}{4} & -\\frac{3}{4}\\end{bmatrix}$.\n\nWhich of the following statements are true?\n\n1. $AB = BA = I_{2}$\n2. $AC = CA = I_{2}$\n3. $B = A^{-1}$",
      ":question/difficulty": ":question.difficulty/moderate",
      ":question/worked-solution": "We must check whether each pair multiplies to $I_2$.\n\nComputing $AB$, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}AB & =\\begin{bmatrix}3 & -2 \\\\ 1 & -2\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}\\frac{1}{2} & \\frac{1}{4} \\\\ -\\frac{1}{2} & -\\frac{3}{4}\\end{bmatrix} \\\\ & =\\begin{bmatrix}\\frac{5}{2} & \\frac{9}{4} \\\\ \\frac{3}{2} & \\frac{7}{4}\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nComputing $AC$, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}AC & =\\begin{bmatrix}3 & -2 \\\\ 1 & -2\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}\\frac{1}{2} & -\\frac{1}{2} \\\\ \\frac{1}{4} & -\\frac{3}{4}\\end{bmatrix} \\\\ & =\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nComputing $CA$, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}CA & =\\begin{bmatrix}\\frac{1}{2} & -\\frac{1}{2} \\\\ \\frac{1}{4} & -\\frac{3}{4}\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}3 & -2 \\\\ 1 & -2\\end{bmatrix} \\\\ & =\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"II only\".",
      ":question/answer-fields": [
        {
          ":answer-field/id": "6e4ee32b-3770-5f82-bddd-569032d3e9b1",
          ":answer-field/key": "selection",
          ":answer-field/type": ":answer-field.type/radio",
          ":answer-field/choices": [
            {
              ":answer/id": "1a4219eb-7380-5add-831f-a1d6c2392949",
              ":answer/type": ":answer.type/text",
              ":answer/value": "None"
            },
            {
              ":answer/id": "b367d566-e4d3-5fec-b358-ba98ee52b497",
              ":answer/type": ":answer.type/text",
              ":answer/value": "I only"
            },
            {
              ":answer/id": "6961e7ae-f68a-584d-8bcd-7ea075107a83",
              ":answer/type": ":answer.type/text",
              ":answer/value": "III only"
            },
            {
              ":answer/id": "6c539733-a72a-5fe6-827a-73007ccaba6e",
              ":answer/type": ":answer.type/text",
              ":answer/value": "I and III only"
            },
