  {
    "knowledge_point": {
      "db_id": 17592186087699,
      "id": "9b9ef325-2358-5041-8a8d-b459e8ed9f09",
      "title": "Determining the Inverse of a 2x2 Matrix"
    },
    "question": {
      ":question/id": "a3cd2ae9-dc73-5bd7-a235-42f15dba4dca",
      ":question/problem": "Consider the matrices\n\n$$\nC=\\begin{bmatrix}-1 & 1 \\\\ 3 & 1\\end{bmatrix},\\,D=\\begin{bmatrix}-\\frac{1}{4} & \\frac{1}{4} \\\\ \\frac{3}{4} & \\frac{1}{4}\\end{bmatrix},\\,E=\\begin{bmatrix}-\\frac{1}{4} & \\frac{1}{4} \\\\ -\\frac{3}{4} & \\frac{1}{4}\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nWhich of the following statements are true?\n\nSelect all that apply.\n\n- **I.** $CD=DC={I}_{2}$\n\n- **II.** $DE=ED={I}_{2}$\n\n- **III.** $D={C}^{-1}$",
      ":question/difficulty": ":question.difficulty/moderate",
      ":question/worked-solution": "- First, we check whether $CD=DC={I}_{2}.$ Computing $CD$, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}CD & =\\begin{bmatrix}-1 & 1 \\\\ 3 & 1\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}-\\frac{1}{4} & \\frac{1}{4} \\\\ \\frac{3}{4} & \\frac{1}{4}\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & ={I}_{2}.\\,\u2713\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nLikewise, computing $DC$, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}DC & =\\begin{bmatrix}-\\frac{1}{4} & \\frac{1}{4} \\\\ \\frac{3}{4} & \\frac{1}{4}\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}-1 & 1 \\\\ 3 & 1\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & ={I}_{2}.\\,\u2713\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, statement I is true. As a result, $D={C}^{-1}$ and statement III is true too.\n\n- Now, we check whether $DE=ED={I}_{2}.$ Computing $DE$, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}DE & =\\begin{bmatrix}-\\frac{1}{4} & \\frac{1}{4} \\\\ \\frac{3}{4} & \\frac{1}{4}\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}-\\frac{1}{4} & \\frac{1}{4} \\\\ -\\frac{3}{4} & \\frac{1}{4}\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}-\\frac{1}{8} & \u2217 \\\\ \u2217 & \u2217\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & \\ne {I}_{2}.\\,\\times \\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, statement II is false.\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"I and III only\".",
      ":question/answer-fields": [
        {
          ":answer-field/id": "44423658-d9e9-59a8-b666-b58db303b94e",
          ":answer-field/key": "I",
          ":answer-field/type": ":answer-field.type/checkbox",
