  {
    "knowledge_point": {
      "db_id": 17592186087699,
      "id": "9b9ef325-2358-5041-8a8d-b459e8ed9f09",
      "title": "Determining the Inverse of a 2x2 Matrix"
    },
    "question": {
      ":question/id": "d8ee91d6-50b9-5e89-9f35-327371e410c2",
      ":question/problem": "Consider the matrices\n\n$$\nB=\\begin{bmatrix}-1 & 1 \\\\ -2 & -2\\end{bmatrix},\\,C=\\begin{bmatrix}-2 & -1 \\\\ 2 & -1\\end{bmatrix},\\,D=\\begin{bmatrix}-\\frac{1}{2} & -\\frac{1}{4} \\\\ \\frac{1}{2} & -\\frac{1}{4}\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nWhich of the following statements are true?\n- **I.** $BC=CB={I}_{2}$\n- **II.** $BD=DB={I}_{2}$\n- **III.** $D={B}^{-1}$\n\nSelect all that apply. If none apply, leave all boxes unchecked.",
      ":question/difficulty": ":question.difficulty/moderate",
      ":question/worked-solution": "- First, we check whether $BC=CB={I}_{2}.$ Computing $BC$, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}BC & =\\begin{bmatrix}-1 & 1 \\\\ -2 & -2\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}-2 & -1 \\\\ 2 & -1\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}4 & \u2217 \\\\ \u2217 & \u2217\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & \\ne {I}_{2}.\\,\\times \\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, statement I is false.\n\n- Now, we check whether $BD=DB={I}_{2}.$ Computing $BD$, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}BD & =\\begin{bmatrix}-1 & 1 \\\\ -2 & -2\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}-\\frac{1}{2} & -\\frac{1}{4} \\\\ \\frac{1}{2} & -\\frac{1}{4}\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & ={I}_{2}.\\,\u2713\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nLikewise, computing $DB$, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}DB & =\\begin{bmatrix}-\\frac{1}{2} & -\\frac{1}{4} \\\\ \\frac{1}{2} & -\\frac{1}{4}\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}-1 & 1 \\\\ -2 & -2\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & ={I}_{2}.\\,\u2713\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, statement II is true. As a result, $D={B}^{-1}$ and statement III is true too.\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"II and III only\".",
      ":question/answer-fields": [
        {
          ":answer-field/id": "65d98d2f-657a-59fb-b783-00c8681f4810",
          ":answer-field/key": "I",
